  "body": "Set in a quiet cul-de-sac in sought-after Mission Bay, this established development offers just two remaining homes, each with its own distinct appeal.\r\n\r\nFreestanding Residence\r\nA private standalone home offering comfortable modern living, ideal for families, downsizers or those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle close to Mission Bay's beaches, cafés and amenities.\r\n\r\nThree-Storey Terrace - Tandem Parking\r\nA well-designed three-level terrace offering generous living across multiple floors, complemented by convenient tandem parking. Perfect for those wanting modern, easy-care living in a highly desirable coastal location.\r\n\r\nOnly 2 units remain - connate Annie today to secure your preferred home today.",
